  "releaseNotes": "0.3.6: This version needs ChromaDotNet.Client 2.9.2. Chroma sends a float it cannot write as null, like the distance to an embedding beyond the range of a float. The client now reads it as NaN. Before, a search or a get with vectors that met one failed as a whole. The READMEs and the package notes use shorter sentences. All the releases: https://github.com/ChromaDotNet/ChromaDB.VectorData/releases",
